# Sandbox isolation (code review)

Authority: [griddungeon-game — Assets/Sandbox/README.md](https://github.com/miramocha/griddungeon-game/blob/main/Assets/Sandbox/README.md), game repo `.gitignore` (`Assets/Sandbox/*` except README).

`Assets/Sandbox/` holds **local, gitignored** experiments. Production code, shipped assets, tests, and CI must **never** depend on sandbox content — clones and agents may not have those files.

## One-way dependency

| Direction | Allowed? |
|-----------|----------|
| Sandbox → production (`Assets/Scripts`, `Assets/UI`, …) | **Yes** — experiments compose shipped APIs |
| Production → Sandbox | **No** — **Blocker** in review |

## When to run

Read this rule when **`sandboxIsolation`** is set in **`.cursor/review-config.json`** and **any changed path** matches **`sandboxIsolation.scanPathGlobs`** (or any changed path is **outside** `Assets/Sandbox/` except `Assets/Sandbox/README.md`).

Scan **every changed file** in the diff (not only files matching `scanPathGlobs`) for sandbox dependency patterns below.

## Blocker — production depends on Sandbox

Flag **Blocker** when tracked / production paths reference sandbox assets or types:

| Pattern | Examples |
|---------|----------|
| Asset path string | `Assets/Sandbox`, `Assets\\Sandbox`, `"Sandbox/Experiments/…"` |
| C# type / namespace from sandbox scripts | `using GridDungeon.Sandbox`, `[SerializeField] Sandbox*` types defined only under `Assets/Sandbox/` |
| `SerializeField` / prefab / scene YAML | GUID or path to `.cs`, `.unity`, `.prefab`, `.mat` under `Assets/Sandbox/` |
| Asset load API | `AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<…>("Assets/Sandbox/…")`, `Resources.Load` paths into Sandbox |
| asmdef edge | Production `.asmdef` `references` or `includePlatforms` pulling in a Sandbox-only asmdef |
| Menu / bootstrap wiring | `DevBootstrapSceneCreator`, `GameState`, phase HUDs, or shipped scenes requiring a Sandbox scene/object to function |

**Fix:** Move the type/asset into a tracked folder (`Assets/Scripts`, `Assets/UI`, …) or remove the reference; keep the experiment fully under `Assets/Sandbox/` with no inbound links.

## OK (do not block)

| Case | Why |
|------|-----|
| Changes **only** under `Assets/Sandbox/**` | Local experiment; not in git |
| `Assets/Sandbox/README.md` | Tracked pointer doc |
| Comment mentioning Sandbox as “do not reference” | Documentation only — no compile/load edge |
| `.gitignore` / review-config / this rule | Policy, not a runtime dependency |

## Reviewer checklist

1. Grep changed files for `Assets/Sandbox`, `Assets\\Sandbox`, and `GridDungeon.Sandbox` (if used).
2. For changed `.unity` / `.prefab` / `.asset` outside Sandbox: confirm no new `guid:` pointing at paths under `Assets/Sandbox/` (when path visible in diff or sidecar `.meta` in the same change set).
3. For changed `.asmdef`: confirm no reference to a Sandbox assembly.
4. **Block merge / close-out** until Blockers are removed or the dependency is promoted out of Sandbox into tracked assets.

## Agent / PR

Pass **`sandboxIsolation.rule`** in **fresh-reviewer** prompts when the path gate matches (**`code-review-config.mdc`**).
